# seo-godlike operator configuration reference
#
# This repository does NOT load dotenv files. Do not copy this file to `.env`
# expecting the CLI to consume it; the values below are represented by explicit
# CLI flags and keyring references. `.env` is intentionally ignored and is not
# an application configuration surface.
#
# Google OAuth:
#   --oauth-client /absolute/path/to/downloaded/client-secret.json
#   --token-store keyring:seo-godlike/google-agency-refresh-token
#
# Registry and output:
#   --registry fixtures/client-registry.json
#   --capabilities fixtures/capability-registry.json
#   --artifacts-dir artifacts/analysis
#
# Ahrefs:
#   keyring:seo-godlike/ahrefs-api-key
#   --ahrefs-date YYYY-MM-DD --ahrefs-country pl
#   --keyword-country pl --allow-estimated-budget
#
# Localo:
#   https://api.localo.com/api/mcp
#   keyring:seo-godlike/localo-mcp-token
#   Discovery remains fail-closed until a managed profile is proven.
#
# SERPROBOT / rank monitoring:
#   --rank-monitoring /path/to/manifest-bound-export
#   or --rank-monitoring-root /path/to/export-root
#   Live API collection remains gated until its official response schema is
#   verified; do not invent an endpoint or put the API key in this repository.
#
# Operator-managed client actions:
#   --client-content-bundle /path/to/manifest-bound-content-bundle
#
# Codex uses the local Codex login/runtime. Never add OPENAI_API_KEY or
# CODEX_API_KEY here; the repository runtime intentionally strips both.
